id: DRAFT-cpputest-4.0-cmake4-policy-flag
title: "CMake>=4 的 CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM 必须经命令行 cache 传入，toolchain 文件变量无效"
error_signature: "Compatibility with CMake < 3.5 has been removed.*CMakeLists.txt.*cmake_minimum_required"
root_cause: "CMake>=4 删除了 <3.5 policy 兼容。cmake_minimum_required 在 CMakeLists 顶部执行，而 CMakeToolchain 文件在 project() 时才加载——通过 conan tc.variables[...] 传的 CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM 是普通变量，写入 toolchain 文件，加载时机晚于 cmake_minimum_required，因此完全不生效（配置仍然失败）。经验汇总 §12.2 已提示'老 policy 变量需在 configure(variables=...) 显式传递'，但未说明根本原因与 toolchain 无效的机理。"
rec_approach: "把 CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM 作为命令行 cache 变量传入：conan 配方中写 cmake.configure(variables={'CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM': '3.5'})（CMake helper 会以 -D 参数传给 cmake，cache 初始化先于 CMakeLists 执行）；等价命令行 cmake -DCMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 ..。"
match_keywords: ["CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM", "cmake_minimum_required", "Compatibility with CMake < 3.5", "conan toolchain", "cmake configure variables"]
error_excerpt: "CMake Error at CMakeLists.txt:8 (cmake_minimum_required): Compatibility with CMake < 3.5 has been removed from CMake."
severity: P1
category: build-system
last_updated: 2026-09-21
rec_command: "cmake.configure(variables={\"CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM\": \"3.5\"})  # conan 配方内"
fallback_approach: "升级项目 CMakeLists 的 cmake_minimum_required 到 >=3.5（改上游生成文件，需走补丁管线并说明）"
fallback_command: "sed -i 's/cmake_minimum_required(VERSION [0-9.]*)/cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5)/' CMakeLists.txt  # 仅当无法传 cache 变量时"
safety_boundary: "仅适用于 CMake>=4 + 项目 cmake_minimum_required<3.5 的组合；变量必须是命令行/初始 cache 形态，写入 toolchain 文件或 project() 之后的普通 set() 均无效。反例：tc.variables['CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM']='3.5' 无效（本包实测）。"
similar_to: "E103, E187"
caused_by: "E187"
similar_note: "E103/E187 记录了'加 CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM 兼容'这一结论，但未记录传参通道差异——toolchain 变量在 cmake_minimum_required 之后才加载，实测无效。本条补全'怎么传才生效'。"
prescan_pattern: "cmake_minimum_required.*VERSION\\s+[12]\\.|VERSION\\s+2\\.[0-9]|VERSION\\s+3\\.[0-4]"
prescan_globs: "**/CMakeLists.txt"
affected_scope: "所有 cmake_minimum_required<3.5 的 CMake 项目在 CMake>=4 环境下的 Conan 配方"
verification_cmd: "grep -n 'CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM' CMakeCache.txt  # 配置成功的构建目录应含 UNINITIALIZED=3.5"
doc_file: ""
authors: DS-7
source_pr: PRE_CREATE
source_commit: ""
metrics_success_count: 1
metrics_fail_count: 0
metrics_confidence: 0.8
metrics_last_used: 2026-09-21
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual
rec_priority: 1
